+# JeRyu Web Forge
+
+JeRyu Web Forge is the browser product layer over the existing JeRyu control
+plane. It exposes all repositories, README rendering, code browsing, issues,
+merge requests, review, approvals, settings, live activity, agents, CI, evidence,
+and audit through a Rust/Axum backend and Vite/React frontend.
+
+## Run locally
+
+```bash
+npm install
+npm run web:dev
+cargo run -p jeryu -- serve
+```
+
+## Product invariants
+
+- Existing CLI/TUI/webhook behavior remains stable.
+- Markdown is rendered and sanitized server-side.
+- Mutations require preview, idempotency, RBAC, and audit.
+- WebSocket events support cursor replay and gap recovery.
+- Merge approvals bind to exact source SHA.

